        "content": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[5];\n    int *p;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n        scanf(\"%d\", &a[i]);\n    }\n\n    p = &a[4];\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n        printf(\"%d\", *p);\n        if (i < 4) {\n            printf(\" \");\n        }\n        p--;\n    }\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n\n    return 0;\n}\n"
