    "description": "Write a C program that reads three integers: x, a, and b.\n\nCreate:\n- a pointer p that points to x\n- a double pointer pp that points to p\n\nThen perform these steps in order:\n1. Use p to add a to x.\n2. Print the value of x after step 1.\n3. Use pp to add b to x.\n4. Print the final value of x after step 3.\n\nInput:\n- Three integers x, a, and b separated by spaces.\n\nOutput:\n- Line 1: the value of x after updating it through p\n- Line 2: the value of x after updating it through pp",
