        "content": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int n;\n    char names[5][31];\n    int i;\n\n    scanf(\"%d\", &n);\n\n    for (i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        scanf(\"%30s\", names[i]);\n    }\n\n    printf(\"First: %s\\n\", names[0]);\n    printf(\"Last: %s\\n\", names[n - 1]);\n    printf(\"Count: %d\\n\", n);\n    printf(\"List:\\n\");\n\n    for (i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        printf(\"%s\\n\", names[i]);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n"
