        "filename": "Main.java",
        "content": "import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int N = sc.nextInt();\n        int Q = sc.nextInt();\n\n        int[] queue = new int[N];\n\n        // Implement a circular array-based queue.\n        // Use f for front index and l for last index.\n        // Process Q operations, then print the final queue state.\n    }\n}\n",
