    "title": "Display Different Contact Details with Overridden toString",
    "description": "Complete the program so that subclasses provide their own string representation while still reusing the parent class behavior.\n\nRequirements:\n- The parent class Contact stores name and phone.\n- Method updatePhone(String newPhone) changes the current phone number.\n- Method toString() in Contact returns: name@phone\n- BusinessContact extends Contact and adds company.\n- EmergencyContact extends Contact and adds relation.\n- Each subclass must override toString() and reuse the parent result.\n  - BusinessContact: name@phone@company\n  - EmergencyContact: name@phone@relation\n\nThe main method reads data for one BusinessContact and one EmergencyContact, updates their phone numbers, stores them in a Contact array, and prints each object using polymorphism.",
