    "title": "Calculate Library Late Fees with Overridden Methods",
    "description": "Complete the class hierarchy so that different library items calculate late fees through the same parent reference.\n\nRequirements:\n- Class LoanItem stores a title and the number of borrowed days.\n- Constructor LoanItem(String title, int borrowedDays) initializes the fields.\n- Method setBorrowedDays(int borrowedDays) updates the borrowed days.\n- Method calculateLateFee() in LoanItem returns 0.\n- Method getReport() in LoanItem returns a string in the format title + \":\" + calculateLateFee().\n- Class Book extends LoanItem and overrides calculateLateFee(). A book is free for the first 7 days. After that, the fee is 2 for each extra day.\n- Class DVD extends LoanItem and overrides calculateLateFee(). A DVD is free for the first 3 days. After that, the fee is 5 for each extra day.\n- If borrowedDays is negative, treat it as 0.\n\nThe provided main method creates one Book and one DVD using the parent type, prints their reports, updates their borrowed days, and prints the reports again. Do not change the main method.",
    "source_chunk_ids": ["6a7f640b682895cb6c9aff68", "6a7f640b682895cb6c9aff6c"],
    "skeleton_code": [
      {
        "filename": "Main.java",
        "content": "import java.util.*;\n\nclass LoanItem {\n    protected String title;\n    protected int borrowedDays;\n\n    public LoanItem(String title, int borrowedDays) {\n        this.title = title;\n        setBorrowedDays(borrowedDays);\n    }\n\n    public void setBorrowedDays(int borrowedDays) {\n    }\n\n    public int calculateLateFee() {\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    public String getReport() {\n        return title + \":\" + calculateLateFee();\n    }\n}\n\nclass Book extends LoanItem {\n    public Book(String title, int borrowedDays) {\n        super(title, borrowedDays);\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public int calculateLateFee() {\n        return 0;\n    }\n}\n\nclass DVD extends LoanItem {\n    public DVD(String title, int borrowedDays) {\n        super(title, borrowedDays);\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public int calculateLateFee() {\n        return 0;\n    }\n}\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        String title1 = sc.next();\n        int days1 = sc.nextInt();\n        String title2 = sc.next();\n        int days2 = sc.nextInt();\n        int newDays1 = sc.nextInt();\n        int newDays2 = sc.nextInt();\n\n        LoanItem item1 = new Book(title1, days1);\n        LoanItem item2 = new DVD(title2, days2);\n\n        System.out.println(item1.getReport());\n        System.out.println(item2.getReport());\n\n        item1.setBorrowedDays(newDays1);\n        item2.setBorrowedDays(newDays2);\n\n        System.out.println(item1.getReport());\n        System.out.println(item2.getReport());\n    }\n}\n",
