    "description": "Complete the RepeatedNotice class so that it inherits from Notice and overrides the format() method.\n\nThe Notice class stores a text message. Its format() method returns the original message.\nThe RepeatedNotice class must return the message two times in the form:\nmessage-message\n\nThe provided main method creates both objects using the same text and stores them in Notice references. Print the result of format() for each object on a new line.",
