    "description": "Write a C program that reads four values in this order: a character, an integer, a float, and a double.\n\nPrint the integral values on the first line and the floating-point values on the second line using this format:\nIntegral: <character> <integer>\nFloating-point: <float> <double>\n\nPrint the float and double values with exactly 2 digits after the decimal point.",
